  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Gender Equality Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program supports 1) ending violence against women and 2) increasing and promoting women&#x2019;s leadership. The program provides long term support to the Vanuatu Women&apos;s Centre (VWC), who advocate against violence against women and children and provide crisis counselling and legal support and are undertaking a nationwide gender-based violence prevalence study. The Young Women&#x2019;s Leadership program provides capacity building to young women, including communication, human rights, and work skills. Core funding to Sista supports the only feminist NGO in Vanuatu.</narrative>
  </description>
